Domain: gripper-strips
Problem: strips-gripper-x-1
Require:
  :strips
Type:
  object
Obj:
  ball1 - object
  ball2 - object
  ball3 - object
  ball4 - object
  left - object
  right - object
  rooma - object
  roomb - object
Predicate:
  (= object object) :eq
  (at object object)
  (at-robby object)
  (ball object)
  (carry object object)
  (free object)
  (gripper object)
  (room object)
Function:
Action:
  drop: ?obj - object ?room - object ?gripper - object
      pre: (and (at-robby ?room) (ball ?obj) (carry ?obj ?gripper) (gripper ?gripper) (room ?room))
      eff: (and (at ?obj ?room) (free ?gripper) (not (carry ?obj ?gripper)))
  move: ?from - object ?to - object
      pre: (and (at-robby ?from) (room ?from) (room ?to))
      eff: (and (at-robby ?to) (not (at-robby ?from)))
  pick: ?obj - object ?room - object ?gripper - object
      pre: (and (at ?obj ?room) (at-robby ?room) (ball ?obj) (free ?gripper) (gripper ?gripper) (room ?room))
      eff: (and (carry ?obj ?gripper) (not (at ?obj ?room)) (not (free ?gripper)))
Init:
  (at ball1 rooma)
  (at ball2 rooma)
  (at ball3 rooma)
  (at ball4 rooma)
  (at-robby rooma)
  (ball ball1)
  (ball ball2)
  (ball ball3)
  (ball ball4)
  (free left)
  (free right)
  (gripper left)
  (gripper right)
  (room rooma)
  (room roomb)
Goal:
  (and (at ball1 roomb) (at ball2 roomb) (at ball3 roomb) (at ball4 roomb))
Metric:
Pred prop:
  (at object object): in_init in_pre in_goal in_eff
  (at-robby object): in_init in_pre in_eff
  (ball object): in_init in_pre
  (carry object object): in_pre in_eff
  (free object): in_init in_pre in_eff
  (gripper object): in_init in_pre
  (room object): in_init in_pre
Func prop:
Global prop:
  is_unit_cost
